                                                    ] ;
                                                    rdfhtml:children (
                                                        [
                                                            a rdfhtml:Text ;
                                                            rdfhtml:data "This is an internal template drafted with AI assistance and not yet reviewed by an attorney. We are a service provider; clients occasionally change legal entities and assign our contract from the old entity (Assignor) to the new one (Assignee). We are always the Counterparty. The template is deliberately Counterparty-protective. We request review and sign-off by an attorney licensed in New York, since many underlying contracts are New York-governed."
                                                        ]
